{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL1RoZSUyME1vc3QlMjBXb25kZXJmdWwlMjBUaW1lJTIwT2YlMjBUaGUlMjBZZWFyJTIwJTI4MjAwOCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"The Most Wonderful Time Of The Year","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/dVDLByvtadEiUJZqjEfIqyXs68l.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/efrMu7NNO9a50WpJyIe3Ju6Suab.jpg","description":"Five-time Emmy nominee and Golden Globe winner Henry Winkler stars in The Most Wonderful Time of the Year, the story of what happens when you open your heart to the power of Christmas. Disenchanted single mom Jennifer Cullen (Brooke Burns) is a Scroogette when it comes to anything Christmas. In fact, even her six-year-old son, Brian, is having trouble believing in Santa Claus. But when her Uncle Ralph (Henry Winkler) visits and brings a fellow passenger from his flight named Morgan Derby (Warren Christie), Jennifer s dubious heart awakens to the possibility that perhaps Christmas really does hold miracles. It s uplifting and laugh-packed and a story that will inspire the whole family to believe.\n\nReleased 13 Dec 2008 · United States of America · Language: English · 88 min\nStudio: KZ Productions, Dan Wigutow Productions, Hallmark Entertainment\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2008","genres":["TV Movie","Drama","Romance","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.4","imdb_id":"tt1327788","moviedb_id":35830,"tmdbId":35830,"runtime":"88 min","cast":["Brooke Burns","Henry Winkler","Warren Christie","Connor Christopher Levins","Woody Jeffreys","Serge Houde","Rebecca Toolan","Michael Roberds"],"director":["Michael M. Scott"],"writer":["Bruce Graham"],"released":"2008-12-13T00:00:00.000Z","country":"United States of America","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Michael M. Scott","character":"Director"},{"name":"Brooke Burns","character":"Jennifer Cullen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8ku22r57rp9Ft0lifZmVcwZ7tz0.jpg"},{"name":"Henry Winkler",